l":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xuut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"065f990c-2f42-43dd-9cc9-d54e37e0fdac","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"とりあえず done ではなくて end ですね","ts":"1620980965.098700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3moX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ea34507-56e1-4d2e-b5b6-0a48621258ca","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"作っている中で疑問があったのでお聞きしたいのですが、\n```until(foo)do\n...\nend```\nこれと同じ動作のために\n```until(foo){\n...\n}```\nこちらのコードは利用できないのでしょうか?do..end ~done~も{}もブロックだと記述があったのでできるかと思ったのですが...\nネットで調べた限りだと、{}だとブロックが(foo)側に渡されてしまい(?)untilに渡されないのでうまく動かないのかなーと考えたのですが、教えていただけると嬉しいです","ts":"1620980747.098400","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1620981156.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AhY2v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5953109-e63a-4356-bfc8-fdbca2441a16","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"またQuine作りました。前回のはちょっとしょぼかったのですが、今回はそれよりはそれっぽくなりました\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/kato-k/a6228790f71f7218d1a9980ce402d35a\u003e","ts":"1620980458.094600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L3Vj"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"\u003c@UFP0GQZ4K\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620926267.093800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
